 "stimulus_html": "<p>For questions 3 – 4, use the following information:</p>\n<blockquote>\n  <p>Scooter rental company A charges $9 per hour plus a $11 initiation fee. Scooter rental company B charges $15 per hour.</p>\n</blockquote>",
 "questions": [
