   "id": 632210,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<ol start=\"3\">\n <li>A customer writes the following inequality to represent the situation: <span data-math=\"9h + 11 > 15h\">9h + 11 &gt; 15h</span>.<br>Which of the following is true about the given inequality?</li>\n</ol>",
   "answers": [
